## When CJ names a person

Keep their existing URL. Example: Fred stays `htsa-enrollment-fred-himburg.html` → `https://closewithcjclay.com/htsa-enrollment-fred-himburg.html`

```bash
cp access/index.html htsa-enrollment-<first>-<last>.html
```

Then edit **only** the BUYER block (and a Clarity/PIF note if he dictated one). Put their name, email, phone, slug.

`show` is the payment menu:

- ClarityPay only → `show: ["clarity"]`
- PIF only → `show: ["pif"]`
- PIF + 4-pay + Clarity → `show: ["pif", "plan", "clarity"]`

Closer ClarityPay is **$600/mo**. Setter ClarityPay is **$300/mo**. Never mix those checkouts.

The one remaining card gets the green highlight (`plan--best`). That is the box CJ means.

